//x.com/DHSgov/status/2094422008452792399', 'edit': {'editTweetIds': ['2094422008452792399'], 'editableUntilMsecs': '1788187693000'}, 'lang': 'en', 'text': \"An innocent baby would still be alive today had it not been for Joe Biden's DISASTROUS open border policy that released MILLIONS of illegal aliens into our country. \\n\\nNew Jersey must honor ICE's detainers on these two criminal illegal aliens to take them out of American communities once and for all.\", 'type': 'tweet', 'author': {'id': '15647676', 'url': 'http://www.dhs.gov/', 'name': 'Homeland Security', 'location': 'Washington, D.C.', 'username': 'DHSgov', 'verified': True, 'createdAt': 'Tue Jul 29 16:32:34 +0000 2008', 'followers': 3011767, 'following': 217, 'protected': False, 'isVerified': True, 'mediaCount': 10319, 'description': 'With honor and integrity, we will safeguard the American people, our homeland, and our values. #WeAreDHS', 'profile_bio': {'entities': {'url': {'urls': [{'url': 'https://t.co/AwsNW68gRr', 'indices': [0, 23], 'display_url': 'dhs.gov', 'expanded_url': 'http://www.dhs.gov/'}]}, 'description': {}}, 'description': 'With honor and integrity, we will safeguard the American people, our homeland, and our values. #WeAreDHS'}, 'coverPicture': 'https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/15647676/1737659629', 'isTranslator': False, 'verifiedType': 'Government', 'statusesCount': 36758, 'isBlueVerified': True, 'pinnedTweetIds': ['2098392615632666675'], 'profilePicture': 'https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1882507181481656320/gzdbVHMv_normal.jpg', 'favouritesCount': 2848, 'profileBannerUrl': 'https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/15647676/1737659629', 'possiblySensitive': False, 'profileImageShape': 'Square', 'hasGraduatedAccess': True, 'superFollowEligible': False, 'profileTranslatorType': 'none', 'parodyCommentaryFanLabel': 'None', 'profileDescriptionLanguage': 'en'}, 'source': '<a href=\"https://mobile.twitter.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter Web App</a>', 'isReply': False, 'entities': {'urls': [], 'hashtags': [], 'user_mentions': []}, 'createdAt': 'Mon Aug 31 13:48:13 +0000 2026', 'likeCount': 2319, 'noteTweet': {'id': 'Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwOTQ0MjIwMDgzOTQxMTcxMjA=', 'text': \"An innocent baby would still be alive today had it not been for Joe Biden's DISASTROUS open border policy that released MILLIONS of illegal aliens into our country. \\n\\nNew Jersey must honor ICE's detainers on these two criminal illegal aliens to take them out of American communities once and for all.\", 'entities': {'urls': [], 'hashtags': [], 'user_mentions': []}, 'isExpandable': True}, 'viewCount': 158969, 'viewState': 'EnabledWithCount', 'quoteCount': 34, 'replyCount': 87, 'isNoteTweet': True, 'quoted_tweet': {'id': '2093867386143199467', 'url': 'https://x.com/BorderHawkNews/status/2093867386143199467', 'edit': {'editTweetIds': ['2093867386143199467'], 'editableUntilMsecs': '1788055461000'}, 'lang': 'en', 'text': \"ICE Lodges Detainers Against Foreign Suspects Charged in Parking Lot Collision That Left Infant Dead, Mother and Young Brother Seriously Injured in Sanctuary New Jersey\\n\\nFederal immigration authorities are seeking custody of two foreign women after a mother and her two young children were run over in New Jersey, leaving a baby dead, authorities say.\\n\\nThe horrifying incident unfolded just before noon on Friday in Ocean County.\\n\\nJackson Township police arrived at the parking lot of a local grocery store where they encountered an adult female and her two children, all of whom had been struck by a vehicle, the Ocean County Prosecutors Office (OCPO) explained in a press release.\\n\\nThe woman, her 5-year-old daughter, and 9-month-old son were all transported to a local hospital, where the infant was pronounced deceased.\\n\\nThe mother and daughter remain hospitalized in stable condition, according to the latest available updates.\\n\\nAuthorities arrested two women at the scene.\\n\\nThe alleged driver, identified as 20-year-old Maria Cobon-Guzman, was charged with Manslaughter, Operating a Motor Vehicle Without Ever Having Possessed or Been Issued a Valid Driver’s License While Involved in a Fatal Motor Vehicle Crash, and two counts of Assault by Auto.\\n\\nThe passenger, identified as 22-year-old Ariadana Lazaro-Flores, was charged with Knowingly Engaging in Conduct Creating a Substantial Risk of Death to Another.\\n\\nLazaro-Flores told investigators she was aware that Cobon-Guzman had never possessed a valid driver's license, OCPO says.\\n\\nImmigration and Customs Enforcement has lodged detainers against the women — who both live in New Jersey — indicating they may be in the U.S. illegally.\\n\\nCharging documents indicate Cobon-Guzman is a citizen of Guatemala and Lazaro-Flores is a citizen of Mexico.\\n\\nBoth suspects are currently being held without bail.\\n\\nWe have reached out to the Department of Homeland Security for more information on this investigation.\", 'type': 'tweet', 'media': [{'id': '2093866782939336704', 'url': 'https://t.co/Yh1G6KJ4mW', 'type': 'photo', 'sizes': {'large': {'h': 1690, 'w': 1446, 'resize': 'fit'}, 'small': {'h': 680, 'w': 582, 'resize': 'fit'}, 'thumb': {'h': 150, 'w': 150, 'resize': 'crop'}, 'medium': {'h': 1200, 'w': 1027, 'resize': 'fit'}}, 'width': 1446, 'height': 1690, 'indices': [276, 299], 'mediaKey': '3_2093866782939336704', 'mediaUrl': 'https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ7ovswW0AAamRU.jpg', 'faceRects': {'orig': [{'h': 224, 'w': 224, 'x': 439, 'y': 184}], 'large': [{'h': 224, 'w': 224, 'x': 439, 'y': 184}], 'small': [{'h': 90, 'w': 90, 'x': 176, 'y': 74}], 'medium': [{'h': 159, 'w': 159, 'x': 311, 'y': 130}]}, 'displayUrl': 'pic.x.com/Yh1G6KJ4mW', 'focusRects': [{'h': 810, 'w': 1446, 'x': 0, 'y': 0}, {'h': 1446, 'w': 1446, 'x': 0, 'y': 0}, {'h': 1648, 'w': 1446, 'x': 0, 'y': 0}, {'h': 1690, 'w': 845, 'x': 464, 'y': 0}, {'h': 1690, 'w': 1446, 'x': 0, 'y': 0}], 'expandedUrl': 'https://x.com/BorderHawkNews/status/2093867386143199467/photo/1', 'allowDownload': True, 'availability